    "detailed_description": "<strong>Can you survive in the MEKA SIGURAT?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEKA SIGURAT FEATURES</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Physically simulated enemies! Blast their limbs off!<br></li><li> Minimal AI cheating! Stealth-action supported!<br></li><li> Upgrades that can be equipped to boost your abilities!<br></li><li> Hireable mercenaries to make you feel less alone!<br></li><li> Huge SHOP with loads of different weapons and items!<br></li><li> Plenty of weapon attachments!<br></li><li> Selectable wave types for different skill levels and challenges!<br></li><li> Many different types of land-based and aerial threats!<br></li><li> Grapple hook!<br></li><li> Placeable sentry guns and cover walls!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182540/extras/0e99407dcff28b7e6d3da16b1376f62f.avif?t=1701987069\" /></div><br><br>A game by kartyd",
